[TITLE]
IO-50: J1 -> C1 -> O1 with a steady 2 cfs inflow carrying 100 mg/L of TSS.
The tests set a NaN lateral flow (5.2.4, 5.3.0, 6.0.0) or a NaN TSS mass
flux (6.0.0) at J1 for one routing step through the toolkit API.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             02:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30

[POLLUTANTS]
;;Name  Units  Crain  Cgw  Crdii  Kdecay
TSS     MG/L   0      0    0      0

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1      10    5         0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type
O1      8     FREE

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  From  To  Length  Roughness  InOffset  OutOffset  InitFlow
C1      J1    O1  400     0.013      0         0         0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape     Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
C1      CIRCULAR  1.5    0      0      0      1

[INFLOWS]
;;Node  Constituent  TimeSeries  Type  Mfactor  Sfactor  Baseline
J1      FLOW         ""          FLOW  1.0      1.0      2.0
J1      TSS          ""          CONCEN 1.0     1.0      100

[REPORT]
CONTINUITY YES
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
